OL,3,GNEWSANipple tattooist 'frustrated' by
OL,4,Aonline censorship
OL,5,
OL,6,FA medical tattoo artist has described
OL,7,Fthe online censorship of nipple tattoos
OL,8,Ffor mastectomy patients as "wholly
OL,9,Funfair and discriminatory".
OL,11,FLauren Carter, based in Hanham near
OL,12,FBristol, says social media bots and
OL,13,Falgorithms often mistakenly flag her
OL,14,Fhyper-realistic work as "inappropriate
OL,15,Fnudity".
OL,17,FCarter has been banned from posting
OL,18,Fnumerous times, and her pictures have
OL,19,Fbeen permanently removed, which she
OL,20,Fsays leaves her "struggling" to reach
OL,21,Fnew clients.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
